| Health Catalyst | $850K | Heavy services |
| Arcadia | $480K | Less workflow |

### Positioning Guidance

- **Premium to Arcadia**: Justify with workflow + integration value
- **Discount to Epic/Cerner**: Emphasize flexibility, speed
- **Competitive with Health Catalyst**: Lower TCO, less services

